@ApacheBalancerBFF_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

### Aggregated status of all configured Apache servers (partial success)
GET {{ApacheBalancerBFF_HostAddress}}/api/balancer/status
Accept: application/json

### Disable a worker
POST {{ApacheBalancerBFF_HostAddress}}/api/balancer/worker/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ServerId": "lb-01",
  "BalancerName": "web-public-backend",
  "WorkerUrl": "https://web-public.app-1.example.com",
  "ActionType": "Disable"
}

### Re-enable a worker (clears Disabled, Drain and Stopped)
POST {{ApacheBalancerBFF_HostAddress}}/api/balancer/worker/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ServerId": "lb-01",
  "BalancerName": "web-public-backend",
  "WorkerUrl": "https://web-public.app-1.example.com",
  "ActionType": "Enable"
}

### Put a worker in draining mode
POST {{ApacheBalancerBFF_HostAddress}}/api/balancer/worker/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ServerId": "lb-01",
  "BalancerName": "web-public-backend",
  "WorkerUrl": "https://web-public.app-1.example.com",
  "ActionType": "Drain"
}
